test.yaml:10:9: this condition starts the job from the text of a comment (the event is "issue_comment"), and nothing checks who wrote it, so anyone who can comment can run the job with the token and the secrets of the repository. check github.event.comment.author_association (OWNER, MEMBER or COLLABORATOR), ask for the permission of github.actor in an earlier step or job, or run the job in an environment with required reviewers [comment-trigger-authorization]
